            , even for general definitions of what
            %em that
            might mean.
          %p
            %strong (Counter-)Example
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒢
